     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Hello, I am in the process of learning LPA and I’m not sure how to interpret the attached plot. Although model 3 with 3 profiles has the lowest BIC, I’m wary of it because it was not able to estimate more than 3 profiles. I am more inclined to choose model 2 with 2 profiles. Is my thinking on the right track?</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;text-align:start\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;text-align:start\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-cK8ai4UsnSA/WzvCJ0okugI/AAAAAAAADLA/cEuLUTwfKKgiipgH81KXFP4R-lAcLN5twCLcBGAs/s1600/Screenshot%2B2018-07-03%2B11.36.05.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-cK8ai4UsnSA/WzvCJ0okugI/AAAAAAAADLA/cEuLUTwfKKgiipgH81KXFP4R-lAcLN5twCLcBGAs/s1600/Screenshot%252B2018-07-03%252B11.36.05.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496167284000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mFMv-VX7NCowB1hOTTgqX\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-cK8ai4UsnSA/WzvCJ0okugI/AAAAAAAADLA/cEuLUTwfKKgiipgH81KXFP4R-lAcLN5twCLcBGAs/s320/Screenshot%2B2018-07-03%2B11.36.05.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"193\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-webkit-standard\"></div>"
