   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Santi, I follow your reasoning here and think it is definitely on the right track. There&#39;s not (to me) any secret to choosing these. I think your reasoning about model type 3 not being perhaps the best candidate because models with greater than 3 profiles do not converge. As you suggested, at least on the basis of these (BIC) values, I&#39;d tend toward a model type 2 solution. But do consider other fit indices as well as how interpretable (and parsimonious) the solution is, I think, too.<br></div><div>Josh<br></div></div>"
    ],
